'''''Scholar, Let Us Meet Again Before the Gates of Truth''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Through the Petals in the Land of Repose]].

==Steps==
# Leave the nether realm and return to the mortal realm
# Go to the moonlight. Castorice is beckoning for you
# Listen to the conversation between Aglaea and Anaxa
# Submit Coreflame
# Listen to the discussion between Black Swan and Himeko

